(wire (pts (xy 289.56 196.85) (xy 297.18 196.85)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid "90f2777a-a150-4ffe-91be-fda88d99f249"))
(text "Circuit follows the ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 v1.1 schematic (ESP USB port, LDO, EN/BOOT, power LED); RGB LED and CP2102N omitted.\nInky header pin -> ESP32-S3:  19 MOSI->IO11   23 SCLK->IO12   24 CS->IO10   15 DC->IO9   13 RST->IO8   11 BUSY->IO7 (input)\n2,4 -> +5V (after D1, as on the DevKit)   1,17 -> ESP_3V3   all header GNDs -> GND\nStrapping: IO0 = BOOT (internal pull-up + button), IO45/IO46 left floating (internal pull-downs), IO3 floating.\nIO35/36/37 are used by the octal PSRAM on N16R8: leave them unconnected.\nFlash over USB-C: hold BOOT, tap RESET (only needed if the running firmware has disabled USB)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "24a2b422-5fa7-4f3f-a054-0f8ee54f21aa"))
